{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/1ae5ce96b05e1146a6580ebf43abf502.avif?t=1771859760\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up. Mess up. Get the job done.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop Chop: Together is a 1\u20134 player co-op party game where teamwork, chaos, and a little bit of betrayal go hand in hand. Take on different professions, race against the clock, and try (very hard) not to ruin your friendships along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fishing boats to busy warehouses, every job is fast-paced and looks simple\u2026 until everything starts going wrong.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/c71ac83bfa62dec743837765f02eec6b.poster.avif?t=1771859760\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/c71ac83bfa62dec743837765f02eec6b.webm?t=1771859760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/c71ac83bfa62dec743837765f02eec6b.mp4?t=1771859760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/a2676190a858896795754703cd527e9f.avif?t=1771859760\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 <strong>Play Together (or Against Each Other)</strong> <br>Play solo or with up to 4 players in online co-op <br>Coordinate, shout, panic, adapt!</p><p class=\"bb_pa